WEBVTT

01:13.533 --> 01:18.853
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.132 --> 01:24.308
[Episode 16]

01:30.052 --> 01:33.548
Aunt Gui, have you finished?

01:33.612 --> 01:34.452
Coming.

01:34.452 --> 01:36.232
You're always rushing me.

01:37.372 --> 01:39.764
Rushing, and rushing.

01:40.732 --> 01:43.052
Why did you make a mess at the table again?

01:43.052 --> 01:44.212
Remember to clean it up.

01:44.212 --> 01:45.372
OK.

01:45.372 --> 01:46.532
What's this?

01:46.532 --> 01:48.532
Don't touch it. It's expensive.

01:48.532 --> 01:50.012
Come on, Aunt Gui.

01:50.092 --> 01:51.372
Have a seat.

01:55.372 --> 01:56.652
Aunt Gui.

01:57.052 --> 01:58.332
Mare's milk.

01:58.812 --> 02:00.196
Mare's milk?

02:01.052 --> 02:03.132
You got it at Yao's horse ranch?

02:03.132 --> 02:04.412
Yes.

02:06.372 --> 02:09.052
I want to make a limited edition.

02:09.452 --> 02:12.452
I made a cup especially for you today.

02:12.452 --> 02:13.732
Have a taste.

02:16.332 --> 02:19.612
This is golden silk black tea.

02:19.612 --> 02:22.832
It's used as the tea base,
mixed with mare's milk.

02:24.252 --> 02:26.404
From what I know about you,

02:27.452 --> 02:28.732
I will

02:29.012 --> 02:30.972
make a cup of milk tea

02:31.732 --> 02:35.660
with my perfect golden ratio.

02:35.772 --> 02:37.108
What an honor.

02:43.292 --> 02:44.052
Taste it.

02:44.052 --> 02:45.332
Alright.

02:45.932 --> 02:47.412
Mr. Ma, it's done.

02:48.132 --> 02:50.772
Personally, I like green
plum tea the most.

02:50.772 --> 02:55.012
Because compared with the sourness
of lemons, it has a milder taste,

02:55.012 --> 02:56.636
so I gave it a 9.

02:58.012 --> 03:01.292
But it's only based on my own feelings.

03:01.292 --> 03:02.732
I don't know much about tea.

03:02.732 --> 03:04.492
It's right to trust your feelings.

03:04.492 --> 03:07.652
The most important thing is it suits your taste.

03:07.932 --> 03:11.852
Why do you think the
customers come to our store?

03:11.852 --> 03:13.772
They want to enjoy the service.

03:13.772 --> 03:17.188
Of course, they can come
once or twice out of novelty.

03:17.212 --> 03:20.108
But what is it that keeps the customers?

03:20.132 --> 03:22.332
It's the product.

03:23.492 --> 03:24.772
Hongdou.

03:25.492 --> 03:29.036
Are you sure you don't like milk tea?

03:29.572 --> 03:30.852
Sort of.

03:30.932 --> 03:33.388
Relative to other
drinks, I prefer pure tea.

03:33.412 --> 03:35.292
Milk tea is just too expensive, right?

03:35.292 --> 03:38.092
It costs 20 or 30 yuan per cup.

03:38.892 --> 03:40.172
Gosh.

03:40.572 --> 03:41.612
How much is it?

03:41.612 --> 03:42.852
Around 30.

03:42.852 --> 03:44.452
30?

03:44.452 --> 03:45.732
Only for such a small cup?

03:45.732 --> 03:46.852
No, no.

03:46.852 --> 03:48.452
This is the limited edition.

03:48.452 --> 03:51.132
I'll sell it at a price of more than 30.

03:51.852 --> 03:53.412
Why is it so expensive?

03:53.412 --> 03:55.036
Is there gold in it?

03:56.252 --> 03:57.532
Aunt Gui.

03:58.012 --> 03:59.852
This is actually a very good idea.

03:59.852 --> 04:03.108
I can consider add some gold leaf to it.

04:03.812 --> 04:06.312
But I have to revise the price again.

04:07.292 --> 04:09.508
Mr. Ma, I don't think

04:09.532 --> 04:11.312
you should sell milk tea.

04:11.452 --> 04:13.292
Just go rob on the street.

04:13.292 --> 04:15.252
You'll get the money faster.

04:15.732 --> 04:21.412
I work so hard from morning
to night, and I only earn 50 yuan.

04:21.412 --> 04:24.476
And only one cup of
your milk tea costs me 30?

04:24.572 --> 04:26.548
I would never buy it.

04:26.572 --> 04:28.580
Aunt Gui, here's the thing.

04:29.292 --> 04:32.568
The milk tea itself is not expensive.

04:32.572 --> 04:35.692
But I have to include my
rent, the cost of utilities

04:35.692 --> 04:38.132
and labor to the price.

04:38.132 --> 04:39.420
Let me ask you.

04:40.092 --> 04:44.308
Where are you going to find
so many suckers to pay for it?

04:44.332 --> 04:45.412
No.

04:45.412 --> 04:46.412
Aunt Gui.

04:46.412 --> 04:48.732
You can't call them suckers.

04:48.732 --> 04:51.412
People have this consumption need.

04:51.412 --> 04:51.972
Yes.

04:51.972 --> 04:52.293
Look.

04:52.293 --> 04:54.612
A cup of milk tea costs 20 or 30 yuan.

04:54.612 --> 04:57.812
For ordinary customers, it's
affordable to drink it once in a while.

04:57.812 --> 05:01.596
But if we drink it every day,
it's indeed a big expense.

05:01.852 --> 05:03.716
That's true.

05:03.812 --> 05:06.072
But you can apply for membership.

05:06.532 --> 05:08.132
But people like me

05:08.132 --> 05:12.132
who'll never fall for the consumption trap
"first cup of milk tea in autumn"

05:12.132 --> 05:13.292
are still the minority.

05:13.292 --> 05:15.132
Mr. Ma, you can ignore me.

05:15.532 --> 05:16.572
Of course.

05:16.572 --> 05:18.132
If you've got a nice environment,

05:18.132 --> 05:20.012
good service and distinctive culture,

05:20.012 --> 05:22.388
your store will be my first choice

05:22.412 --> 05:24.452
if I'm going to meet people for business.

05:24.452 --> 05:28.620
After all, a lot of people want
to support domestic brands now.

05:29.132 --> 05:30.292
Hongdou.

05:30.292 --> 05:32.252
You are a great help to me.

05:32.812 --> 05:35.828
Especially in terms of product promotion.

05:36.012 --> 05:39.220
How to increase customer stickiness?

05:39.732 --> 05:43.660
We haven't done enough consumer research.

05:44.212 --> 05:49.532
I'm glad I could be of help, so I
didn't drink your tea for nothing.

05:49.852 --> 05:52.132
You can always drink my tea for free.

05:52.132 --> 05:53.468
If I were you,

05:53.772 --> 05:58.092
I'd buy some milk in the
supermarket, and boil my own black tea,

05:58.092 --> 06:00.484
that's the same, isn't it?

06:00.732 --> 06:03.172
I would never fall for your trick.

06:03.332 --> 06:07.212
He just swindles rich people out of their money.

06:07.212 --> 06:07.573
No, no, no.

06:07.573 --> 06:09.292
It's not swindle.

06:09.292 --> 06:11.628
He does business,

06:11.652 --> 06:14.476
and should have his own customer group.

06:19.212 --> 06:20.596
Right.

06:20.852 --> 06:22.380
Hongdou's right.

06:22.772 --> 06:26.332
Am I being a nuisance here?

06:26.332 --> 06:27.452
Look.

06:27.452 --> 06:31.972
Mr. Ma is treating me
to his expensive milk tea,

06:31.972 --> 06:33.972
and I said some unpleasant things.

06:33.972 --> 06:35.412
It's my bad, Mr. Ma.

06:35.412 --> 06:36.692
It's nothing.

06:37.092 --> 06:39.772
I should learn from the myna,

06:39.772 --> 06:44.388
whenever I see you, I'll say,
"Good day", yummy, yummy."

06:44.412 --> 06:45.132
Don't.

06:45.132 --> 06:46.452
Aunt Gui.

06:46.452 --> 06:48.952
You have to stay true to who you are.

06:49.572 --> 06:53.164
Do you know why I like you?

06:53.292 --> 06:56.348
It's just because of your

06:56.732 --> 06:57.972
honesty.

06:57.972 --> 06:59.532
You always speak your mind.

06:59.532 --> 07:01.432
You're frank and outspoken.

07:01.772 --> 07:03.192
I like you so much.

07:04.132 --> 07:06.092
You flatter me.

07:06.332 --> 07:07.892
All he does is praise me.

07:07.892 --> 07:10.392
You just don't sound like a nice guy.

07:10.652 --> 07:11.972
Alright.

07:11.972 --> 07:13.212
I haven't finished my work yet.

07:13.212 --> 07:15.592
I don't have time to chat with you.

07:19.332 --> 07:21.484
This tastes pretty good.

07:21.772 --> 07:22.452
I'm off, I'm off.

07:22.452 --> 07:23.732
OK, OK.

07:24.092 --> 07:26.412
Come here for more if you're done.

07:28.852 --> 07:31.292
Damai, you haven't finished writing?

07:31.972 --> 07:33.252
Almost.

07:45.412 --> 07:48.428
Are you writing your graduation thesis?

07:48.452 --> 07:49.292
Look.

07:49.292 --> 07:50.572
Let me see.

07:52.132 --> 07:52.972
Damai.

07:52.972 --> 07:55.708
You're writing a novel for the tea leaves?

07:55.732 --> 07:59.748
What do you mean the love
between soy milk and Pu'er tea

07:59.772 --> 08:01.912
is not acceptable in the world?

08:06.212 --> 08:07.452
Damai.

08:07.452 --> 08:08.788
This is good.

08:09.532 --> 08:10.812
What?

08:12.772 --> 08:14.532
Could you write a story for me?

08:14.532 --> 08:15.812
No.

08:16.212 --> 08:17.772
It's a very simple story.

08:17.772 --> 08:20.652
Let's personify the soy milk and
make a cartoon character of it.

08:20.652 --> 08:21.932
I mean

08:22.012 --> 08:23.432
you need to pay me.

08:24.852 --> 08:26.332
We're all adults.

08:26.332 --> 08:28.652
There's no such thing as a free story.

08:28.652 --> 08:30.732
But I can give you a discount.

08:31.532 --> 08:33.772
It's no big deal.

08:33.772 --> 08:35.092
Isn't it just money?

08:35.092 --> 08:35.772
You name a price.

08:35.772 --> 08:36.772
Deal.

08:36.772 --> 08:38.552
We'll work well together.

08:42.012 --> 08:43.432
I'm writing it now.

08:45.092 --> 08:47.100
Hello? My package?

08:47.532 --> 08:49.212
Just put it at the delivery station.

08:49.212 --> 08:50.492
OK, thank you.

08:51.532 --> 08:52.572
I'm going to pick up my package.

08:52.572 --> 08:53.852
Go ahead.

09:14.132 --> 09:18.012
Master, hit me again.

09:18.052 --> 09:19.484
Let's go.

09:27.292 --> 09:28.572
Master.

09:28.972 --> 09:29.852
Master.

09:29.852 --> 09:31.132
What?

09:31.772 --> 09:33.312
What are you carving?

09:33.892 --> 09:35.372
Can't you see it?

09:35.972 --> 09:39.756
We're customizing this wood
carved lotus for the hotel.

09:39.852 --> 09:41.572
Check out my master's skills.

09:41.572 --> 09:43.820
Look at the details. It's art.

09:44.652 --> 09:48.244
Why don't you focus on your
work instead of fawning at me?

09:50.132 --> 09:51.772
Don't film me.

09:51.772 --> 09:53.092
Film yourself.

09:53.092 --> 09:54.012
Annoying.

09:54.012 --> 09:54.972
Master.

09:54.972 --> 09:56.532
Our fans want to see you.

09:56.532 --> 09:58.372
They think you're awesome.

09:58.732 --> 10:00.012
I'm awesome?

10:00.612 --> 10:01.572
Go, go, go.

10:01.572 --> 10:02.572
Stop it.

10:02.572 --> 10:03.956
Stop filming me.

10:14.572 --> 10:15.692
Master.

10:15.692 --> 10:17.292
I have a gift for you.

10:17.452 --> 10:18.732
I don't want it.

10:18.972 --> 10:21.940
Master, give me your hand.

10:25.852 --> 10:27.332
What is it?

10:30.052 --> 10:31.452
You brat!

10:31.452 --> 10:31.972
Stop there!

10:31.972 --> 10:32.692
Run, run, run.

10:32.692 --> 10:33.972
You stop there!

10:34.132 --> 10:36.012
You... Stop!

10:36.012 --> 10:37.312
Stop right there.

10:37.612 --> 10:38.892
Don't run.

10:40.452 --> 10:44.188
I really like this "Master,
hit me again" series.

10:44.212 --> 10:46.492
And those "Senior, please
give me your advice" videos.

10:46.492 --> 10:47.612
They're not bad, either.

10:47.612 --> 10:50.612
But it's so funny to see
how your master hits you.

10:50.612 --> 10:52.252
My master hits me really hard.

10:52.252 --> 10:53.532
It hurts.

10:53.972 --> 10:55.092
Easy on the drink.

10:55.092 --> 10:56.092
It's late in the afternoon.

10:56.092 --> 10:57.992
It'll keep you up at night.

10:58.252 --> 11:00.188
I still need to work tonight.

11:00.212 --> 11:02.612
Since when did you start to work so hard?

11:02.612 --> 11:05.732
My master asked me to
work more and practice more

11:05.732 --> 11:08.592
to set an example for the junior disciples.

11:09.332 --> 11:10.452
Our Xiaxia is a big boy now.

11:10.452 --> 11:11.692
You've grown up.

11:11.692 --> 11:13.172
Don't touch my hair.

11:22.452 --> 11:24.892
Why do you look so happy?

11:25.732 --> 11:28.472
Because now I have someone to pick me up.

11:33.252 --> 11:34.532
Seriously,

11:34.732 --> 11:37.252
you always stay in your room, yet
you came to pick me up from work.

11:37.252 --> 11:39.992
Are you sure you're not forcing yourself?

11:40.812 --> 11:45.256
I... I know sitting too
long is bad for our health.

11:47.212 --> 11:49.172
I have experience with this.

11:50.172 --> 11:53.948
When we're living
at very painful moments in your life,

11:53.972 --> 11:57.548
all we do is having negative
thoughts and overthinking.

11:57.572 --> 12:00.428
It's not going to help solve problems at all.

12:00.452 --> 12:02.220
But during this time,

12:02.252 --> 12:04.164
as long as we walk out,

12:04.572 --> 12:05.956
chat to people,

12:06.452 --> 12:08.412
get some fresh air

12:08.572 --> 12:10.052
and sunlight,

12:10.732 --> 12:12.788
and have some delicious food,

12:12.812 --> 12:15.252
we'll get our power back slowly.

12:22.972 --> 12:24.892
I will listen to you.

12:24.892 --> 12:28.412
I'll come out for a walk, get out in
the sun, and eat some good food.

12:28.412 --> 12:29.452
OK.

12:29.452 --> 12:31.612
What are we having for dinner?

12:31.612 --> 12:32.452
What would you like to eat?

12:32.452 --> 12:33.532
I'll cook it for you.

12:33.532 --> 12:35.012
Let me think.

12:39.492 --> 12:40.332
Uncle.

12:40.332 --> 12:41.612
Yao.

12:44.572 --> 12:46.100
She's still asleep?

12:49.612 --> 12:50.892
Xu Hongdou.

12:52.052 --> 12:54.132
You were woken up by the bird?

13:24.332 --> 13:25.612
Dad.

13:25.812 --> 13:27.652
Going to fetch some water?

13:31.332 --> 13:33.724
That's a tenant in the Yard.

13:35.372 --> 13:36.652
I can see that.

14:06.972 --> 14:08.252
Hei.

14:11.092 --> 14:12.380
Hei.

14:13.452 --> 14:14.836
Jiahui.

14:15.612 --> 14:17.092
What are you eating?

14:30.452 --> 14:31.732
Uncle.

14:31.852 --> 14:33.052
You're back.

14:33.052 --> 14:34.332
Hu.

14:34.852 --> 14:35.972
Hello, uncle.

14:35.972 --> 14:37.788
When did you come back?

14:38.212 --> 14:39.332
It's the day of remembrance of Yao's grandpa.

14:39.332 --> 14:41.112
I came to sweep his tomb.

14:42.572 --> 14:44.052
Are things going well at home?

14:44.052 --> 14:44.732
Yes.

14:44.732 --> 14:46.252
Has Yuan been obedient lately?

14:46.252 --> 14:47.212
Yes.

14:47.212 --> 14:48.812
He's started to learn.

14:48.932 --> 14:50.212
That's great.

14:50.212 --> 14:53.052
A while ago, Mr. Xie
was so worried about him.

14:53.052 --> 14:58.188
Boys of his age are... Have
you finished writing the new song?

14:58.212 --> 14:59.812
Uncle, I haven't written any songs.

14:59.812 --> 15:01.572
If I write a new one, I'll
send it to you right away.

15:01.572 --> 15:03.972
When you deliver the goods,
you can listen to it for refreshment.

15:03.972 --> 15:05.212
No need.

15:05.212 --> 15:09.152
We never listen to those whining noises
when delivering goods.

15:09.252 --> 15:12.708
Can't you write something
like Phoenix Legend's songs?

15:12.732 --> 15:14.644
How exciting that is!

15:18.172 --> 15:19.952
It's not the same, uncle.

15:20.092 --> 15:21.572
You can make some changes

15:21.572 --> 15:24.092
and write some songs
that we common people like to hear.

15:24.092 --> 15:25.372
Such as

15:26.212 --> 15:29.332
I swim like a fish in a pond.

15:29.332 --> 15:30.452
That one.

15:30.452 --> 15:32.828
That's... That's uplifting.

15:32.852 --> 15:36.852
Yuan's mother spend two
hours outside every day,

15:36.852 --> 15:39.052
and she's very happy.

15:39.092 --> 15:40.692
Those songs are great.

15:41.452 --> 15:42.252
Okay, uncle.

15:42.252 --> 15:43.932
I... I'll work on that.

15:43.932 --> 15:44.612
OK.

15:44.612 --> 15:45.892
Go for it.

15:46.172 --> 15:47.712
I'll leave you to it.

15:50.052 --> 15:51.332
Bye, uncle.

15:51.492 --> 15:52.372
Go get busy.

15:52.372 --> 15:53.672
Take care, uncle.

16:17.612 --> 16:18.892
Aunt Hua.

16:19.092 --> 16:19.693
Uncle, aunt.

16:19.693 --> 16:21.252
Are you going back to Guangzhou?

16:21.252 --> 16:22.572
Yeah, things are busy in the factory.

16:22.572 --> 16:24.492
The boss called and urged us to go back.

16:24.492 --> 16:25.852
It's good to be busy.

16:25.852 --> 16:27.492
They're paid on a piecework basis.

16:27.492 --> 16:30.328
The more work they do,
the more money they earn.

16:31.172 --> 16:32.988
What are you going to do?

16:33.092 --> 16:35.232
We're going to pick someone up.

16:37.092 --> 16:38.332
[Woodfish Grocery Store]

16:38.332 --> 16:38.853
Sister.

16:38.853 --> 16:40.852
I want the pineapple flavor.

16:40.852 --> 16:42.492
I want the peach flavor.

16:42.492 --> 16:44.092
I want the pineapple flavor, too.

16:44.092 --> 16:45.492
I want the peach flavor.

16:45.492 --> 16:46.772
Okay.

16:49.412 --> 16:50.692
Here you are.

16:50.852 --> 16:51.692
Thank you.

16:51.692 --> 16:52.332
Thank you.

16:52.332 --> 16:52.932
Thank you.

16:52.932 --> 16:54.212
You're welcome.

17:06.612 --> 17:09.932
Tuotuo, thank you for
treating us to popsicles.

17:09.932 --> 17:11.692
Don't worry, I have money.

17:11.692 --> 17:14.252
My dad and mom are leaving in a few days.

17:14.252 --> 17:17.668
Now, they give me pocket money every day.

17:17.692 --> 17:18.572
Isn't it nice?

17:18.572 --> 17:20.732
Every time your dad and mom come back,

17:20.732 --> 17:24.564
they'll bring you a lot of good food and toys.

17:25.332 --> 17:28.308
I want my dad to sell barbecues in Kunming, too.

17:28.332 --> 17:30.372
Then let's ask Uncle Yao to talk to him

17:30.372 --> 17:33.028
and let him go out to make more money.

17:33.052 --> 17:35.092
Uncle Yao won't do that.

17:35.092 --> 17:38.348
He wants everyone in the village to come back.

17:38.692 --> 17:40.364
Uncle Yao's so bad.

17:41.212 --> 17:42.492
A bad person.

17:47.092 --> 17:49.436
Why are you guys all here?

17:49.732 --> 17:50.572
Huzi.

17:50.572 --> 17:51.852
Your mom is leaving.

17:51.852 --> 17:53.732
Why are you still eating a popsicle here?

17:53.732 --> 17:55.020
Where's my mom?

17:55.612 --> 17:58.228
She's waiting at the entrance of the town.

17:58.252 --> 18:00.884
Mom, mom.

18:01.452 --> 18:02.836
Mom.

18:03.092 --> 18:03.812
Let's go.

18:03.812 --> 18:05.092
Mom.

18:05.892 --> 18:06.812
Mom.

18:06.812 --> 18:08.092
Huzi.

18:08.092 --> 18:09.612
Huzi.

18:09.612 --> 18:12.092
Huzi, Huzi.

18:12.092 --> 18:13.764
Huzi.

18:13.852 --> 18:14.452
Aunt Hua.

18:14.452 --> 18:16.092
Aren't you going with Honghong?

18:16.092 --> 18:17.212
I'd love to.

18:17.212 --> 18:19.412
But what am I going to do there?

18:20.852 --> 18:21.772
Take care of yourself, mom.

18:21.772 --> 18:22.932
You too.

18:22.932 --> 18:23.972
Don't work too hard.

18:23.972 --> 18:24.572
Get more rest.

18:24.572 --> 18:25.692
Give me a hug.

18:25.692 --> 18:26.092
And you too.

18:26.092 --> 18:26.853
Take care of yourself.

18:26.853 --> 18:28.333
Don't work too hard.

18:29.732 --> 18:31.932
Every time I go back to Beijing,

18:31.972 --> 18:34.532
my mom would say the same thing to me.

18:41.052 --> 18:42.292
Oh no, Huzi is coming.

18:42.292 --> 18:43.412
Mom.

18:43.412 --> 18:45.132
Huzi.

18:45.172 --> 18:45.933
Get in the car.

18:45.933 --> 18:46.972
Come on, get in the car.

18:46.972 --> 18:47.532
Huzi.

18:47.532 --> 18:48.172
You can't go.

18:48.172 --> 18:48.813
Don't run.

18:48.813 --> 18:50.132
Or you won't be able to leave.

18:50.132 --> 18:51.212
Come back.

18:51.212 --> 18:51.652
Leave it to me.

18:51.652 --> 18:52.772
Get in the car.

18:52.772 --> 18:54.684
Get in the car, come on.

18:57.532 --> 18:58.133
Huzi.

18:58.133 --> 19:00.212
Huzi, your mom will be back soon.

19:00.212 --> 19:00.893
Don't run, don't run.

19:00.893 --> 19:02.708
I'm here with you.

19:03.292 --> 19:05.204
Don't run, my baby.

19:06.252 --> 19:13.972
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

19:14.532 --> 19:21.092
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

19:21.092 --> 19:25.212
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

19:25.212 --> 19:28.732
Do you know why Huang and I
are doing all these things?

19:29.452 --> 19:30.612
That's the reason.

19:30.612 --> 19:32.652
I'll buy you an Ultraman, okay?

19:32.652 --> 19:35.228
I'll buy you an Ultraman and snacks.

19:40.492 --> 19:41.452
Huzi.

19:41.452 --> 19:42.732
Come on.

19:42.732 --> 19:43.732
Get up.

19:43.732 --> 19:44.173
It's fine.

19:44.173 --> 19:46.132
It's fine, it's fine.

19:46.132 --> 19:47.452
It's fine, it's fine.

19:47.452 --> 19:48.452
Alright, it's fine.

19:48.452 --> 19:51.228
I'll take you to feed horses, alright?

19:51.252 --> 19:53.212
I'll buy you popsicles, alright?

19:53.212 --> 19:54.752
Don't cry, don't cry.

19:55.212 --> 19:57.364
It's fine, it's fine.

19:58.692 --> 19:59.173
It's fine, it's fine.

19:59.173 --> 20:00.653
Aunt Hua, it's fine.

20:12.292 --> 20:14.092
It's fine, it's fine.

20:14.092 --> 20:18.836
I'll take you to feed the
horses and buy you popsicles.

20:21.652 --> 20:22.412
Hello.

20:22.412 --> 20:22.813
Hello.

20:22.813 --> 20:24.532
Are you Sunzi and Fang?

20:24.532 --> 20:25.012
Yes, hello.

20:25.012 --> 20:25.532
I'm Sunzi.

20:25.532 --> 20:26.772
Hello, I'm Xu Hongdou.

20:26.772 --> 20:28.292
Huang Xinxin's in a meeting.

20:28.292 --> 20:29.772
She asked President Xie and me to pick you up.

20:29.772 --> 20:32.752
President... That's President Xie.

20:38.212 --> 20:39.752
Uncle Siping is here.

20:39.892 --> 20:40.972
The old man is here?

20:40.972 --> 20:41.892
Is it too late to run now?

20:41.892 --> 20:43.852
Aunt, are you busy?

20:44.252 --> 20:45.532
Gezi.

20:46.732 --> 20:47.892
Uncle, you're here.

20:47.892 --> 20:50.212
Ye Sen, I've been looking for you.

20:50.812 --> 20:52.428
I just went to

20:52.452 --> 20:53.892
your small warehouse for a spin.

20:53.892 --> 20:55.892
Yue said you're having a day off today.

20:55.892 --> 20:57.172
Yes.

20:57.652 --> 20:59.012
And now you are...

20:59.492 --> 21:00.572
Gezi asked me to help her.

21:00.572 --> 21:02.652
Colleagues should help each other.

21:02.652 --> 21:04.612
Yes, I asked him to help me.

21:05.252 --> 21:06.828
Then you go ahead.

21:21.652 --> 21:23.900
Uncle, am I interrupting you?

21:24.532 --> 21:26.852
I just want to have a casual chat.

21:27.252 --> 21:28.532
Don't mind me.

21:34.812 --> 21:38.972
Yao's helping Heshun renovate
his woodcarving workshop,

21:38.972 --> 21:39.972
and promote it.

21:39.972 --> 21:41.404
Is it for free?

21:43.972 --> 21:45.872
Why are you looking at him?

21:46.332 --> 21:48.572
Your handicraft website is
still selling wood carvings

21:48.572 --> 21:50.572
from the woodcarving workshop, right?

21:51.532 --> 21:53.492
Does Yao only help them

21:53.652 --> 21:55.672
or want a share of the money?

21:56.732 --> 21:58.132
Ye Sen, uncle's asking you.

21:58.132 --> 21:59.412
Don't ask me. My leg hurts.

21:59.412 --> 22:00.692
It doesn't.

22:03.252 --> 22:05.356
Don't you guys know it?

22:06.452 --> 22:07.772
Ye Sen.

22:07.772 --> 22:09.492
You designed the website

22:09.532 --> 22:10.412
and posted the goods.

22:10.412 --> 22:11.212
Gezi.

22:11.212 --> 22:12.492
Right?

22:14.252 --> 22:16.548
Well... I suppose...

22:18.012 --> 22:19.372
he's helping them.

22:19.692 --> 22:21.268
It seems so.

22:23.252 --> 22:24.532
He's helping.

22:25.932 --> 22:29.285
So you mean he's working
for Heshun for nothing.

22:33.452 --> 22:34.932
I'll let you get on with it.

22:34.932 --> 22:36.012
Bye, uncle.

22:36.012 --> 22:37.252
Aunt, I'm leaving.

22:37.252 --> 22:38.532
See you.

22:39.012 --> 22:40.772
Finally, he's gone.

22:40.772 --> 22:41.533
Let's get to work.

22:41.533 --> 22:43.412
So we can have dinner sooner.

22:43.412 --> 22:45.132
We caused trouble again.

22:46.332 --> 22:49.108
[To Freedom]

24:16.532 --> 24:17.812
Take a try.

24:25.732 --> 24:27.012
Nice.

24:32.412 --> 24:33.692
This is right.

24:35.052 --> 24:36.332
Come out

24:36.732 --> 24:38.548
for some sunlight.

24:39.692 --> 24:41.052
How comfy that is!

24:42.052 --> 24:43.436
It's good for you

24:43.932 --> 24:45.212
to write books.

24:46.572 --> 24:47.852
And also,

24:48.172 --> 24:49.472
when you're free,

24:49.892 --> 24:51.708
talk to me more,

24:52.572 --> 24:54.004
which is also good

24:54.212 --> 24:55.812
for me to write songs.

25:02.052 --> 25:03.332
The wind rises.

25:07.532 --> 25:09.252
I just wrote a lyric.

25:12.412 --> 25:15.380
Blow it away, blow...

25:17.772 --> 25:19.780
Why is he back again?

25:20.252 --> 25:21.532
Who is it?

25:22.252 --> 25:24.108
Phoenix Legend's fan,

25:24.132 --> 25:25.432
Mr. Xie's father.

25:26.492 --> 25:28.020
Be careful of him.

25:28.132 --> 25:29.732
I should go hide in my room.

25:29.732 --> 25:30.812
Bye.

25:30.812 --> 25:32.092
Be careful.

26:00.572 --> 26:02.292
Who are you looking for?

26:02.492 --> 26:04.908
You must be Xu Hongdou, right?

26:04.932 --> 26:06.172
Yes, I am.

26:06.172 --> 26:08.420
I'm Xie Zhiyao's father.

26:09.892 --> 26:12.092
Uncle Xie, hello.

26:12.572 --> 26:13.452
Stay there, stay.

26:13.452 --> 26:14.412
Sit down, sit down.

26:14.412 --> 26:15.732
Sit, sit.

26:15.732 --> 26:17.012
Sit.

26:20.292 --> 26:21.572
Bye.

26:32.892 --> 26:38.404
Is Yuan doing well in his school?

26:38.532 --> 26:39.972
He knows to study hard now.

26:39.972 --> 26:41.252
Right?

26:42.652 --> 26:43.940
That's great.

26:45.412 --> 26:46.892
This yard

26:47.252 --> 26:48.652
is well decorated now.

26:48.652 --> 26:49.892
Yes.

26:49.892 --> 26:52.428
Aunt Gui's very attentive.

26:54.492 --> 26:56.532
Have you got used to living here?

26:56.532 --> 26:57.812
I have.

26:58.492 --> 27:02.452
It's fine if you only live here
for a month or two, but over time,

27:02.452 --> 27:03.980
you'll miss Beijing.

27:05.172 --> 27:06.452
Maybe.

27:15.132 --> 27:16.756
Do you have something

27:16.892 --> 27:18.172
to say to me?

27:20.212 --> 27:21.692
I just ran into you.

27:21.732 --> 27:22.972
Just chitchatting.

27:22.972 --> 27:24.252
OK.

27:24.892 --> 27:27.228
I heard Yao's granny say

27:27.252 --> 27:30.268
Yao listens to whatever you say.

27:30.972 --> 27:32.252
No.

27:32.692 --> 27:33.892
This may be a misunderstanding.

27:33.892 --> 27:35.180
Me and him

27:35.452 --> 27:37.748
only talk about business.

27:38.212 --> 27:39.292
That's perfect.

27:39.292 --> 27:41.412
I want to talk about business with you.

27:41.412 --> 27:44.548
Could you give me some ideas?

27:44.572 --> 27:46.196
Sure, go ahead.

27:47.732 --> 27:49.012
Look.

27:49.012 --> 27:51.356
Yunmiao is a village.

27:51.652 --> 27:55.388
Young people who're good at
studies all go to the big cities.

27:55.412 --> 27:58.268
Those who aren't good at
studies, but are quick-witted,

27:58.292 --> 28:00.396
would buy a car and go to

28:00.692 --> 28:06.932
Shuanglang, Xizhou, the Old Town,
or other busy places to do business.

28:06.932 --> 28:11.292
But in such a small village,
even if we shout all we like,

28:11.292 --> 28:13.432
only a few people will hear us.

28:14.212 --> 28:15.492
You're right.

28:15.572 --> 28:17.628
But personally, I feel

28:17.652 --> 28:20.308
we can't make generalizations.

28:20.332 --> 28:21.932
Because before those places were developed,

28:21.932 --> 28:26.172
they were also some fishing
villages and old towns, right?

28:26.172 --> 28:27.332
Yeah.

28:27.332 --> 28:30.548
It's like how we buy flowers
wholesale in the market.

28:30.572 --> 28:32.492
At first, few people are in the business,

28:32.492 --> 28:34.452
so we can turn a small shop into a big one.

28:34.452 --> 28:37.572
But when the shop grows bigger, we
sell more and have more customers.

28:37.572 --> 28:40.492
If we have a nice source of
goods, the floral supply base

28:40.492 --> 28:41.924
will be willing

28:41.972 --> 28:46.972
to give us the rare breeds, and
the best flowers at the best price.

28:46.972 --> 28:48.652
You have a big shop, right?

28:48.652 --> 28:50.692
So you have better sales, more
customers, and you can make more money

28:50.692 --> 28:52.332
to expand your business.

28:52.332 --> 28:54.252
How can the small shops that are just opened

28:54.252 --> 28:56.788
compete with the big shops?

28:57.692 --> 28:58.572
It makes sense.

28:58.572 --> 28:59.252
Right?

28:59.252 --> 29:01.356
But I personally think

29:02.252 --> 29:04.868
we can't compare them like this.

29:04.892 --> 29:08.972
You see, the shops
purchase the same stuff.

29:08.972 --> 29:10.868
But in the tourist resorts,

29:10.892 --> 29:12.180
each place

29:12.492 --> 29:14.212
has a different scenery.

29:14.452 --> 29:15.732
Am I right?

29:17.012 --> 29:18.292
Fine.

29:18.452 --> 29:20.388
Let's not compare with them.

29:20.412 --> 29:21.212
Let's change a topic.

29:21.212 --> 29:22.752
Take Yao for example.

29:23.412 --> 29:24.692
Back then,

29:24.812 --> 29:27.412
his mom went to work outside
so that he could study hard

29:27.412 --> 29:28.940
to go to a big city,

29:29.412 --> 29:32.548
leave this small village
and don't stay poor.

29:32.572 --> 29:33.892
Yao lived up to our expectations

29:33.892 --> 29:35.932
and got admitted to a college in Beijing.

29:35.932 --> 29:38.460
He got a good job there and decent pay.

29:38.652 --> 29:40.252
But he insisted on coming back

29:40.252 --> 29:42.252
and invested all the money he earned here.

29:42.252 --> 29:43.912
He even got some loans.

29:44.492 --> 29:47.452
He's been throwing his money in the rabbit hole.

29:47.452 --> 29:49.772
We can see some buses in the town.

29:49.772 --> 29:51.252
But what about here?

29:51.292 --> 29:54.548
In this small village,
there aren't even tourists.

29:55.252 --> 29:56.532
Yes.

29:56.532 --> 29:57.812
You're right.

29:58.052 --> 29:59.332
Right?

29:59.812 --> 30:00.572
Look.

30:00.572 --> 30:02.732
Parents are always able to think bigger

30:02.732 --> 30:04.812
and long-term for their children.

30:04.812 --> 30:05.972
That's the way my parents are.

30:05.972 --> 30:06.732
Look.

30:06.732 --> 30:08.012
Look.

30:08.132 --> 30:11.428
That's why Yao's granny likes you.

30:11.452 --> 30:12.932
Look at you.

30:13.012 --> 30:14.492
I'm quite impressed.

30:15.012 --> 30:16.292
You're smart.

30:17.132 --> 30:19.380
And you're a sweet talker.

30:27.452 --> 30:28.532
Uncle.

30:28.532 --> 30:30.060
Well,

30:30.572 --> 30:33.892
did you say all these
to me just to complain

30:33.892 --> 30:36.188
or do you want me to persuade Yao

30:36.452 --> 30:38.052
to go back to Beijing?

30:39.772 --> 30:41.052
That's it.

30:42.452 --> 30:44.908
You see, since Yao came back,

30:44.932 --> 30:47.412
he hasn't got any benefits.

30:47.412 --> 30:49.672
He's everyone's go-to person now.

30:50.692 --> 30:51.932
A lot of things are occupying him.

30:51.932 --> 30:55.732
How's Xie Heshun's woodcarving
workshop have anything to do with him?

30:55.732 --> 30:56.508
Well...

30:56.532 --> 30:58.412
Well... And this... this homestay.

30:58.412 --> 30:59.652
What has he got to do with it?

30:59.652 --> 31:02.292
Huang is the leader,
she has to be in charge.

31:02.292 --> 31:04.772
But once something happens,
people all go to Yao for help.

31:04.772 --> 31:06.396
That's so troublesome.

31:08.292 --> 31:09.572
Right.

31:10.252 --> 31:13.053
But Yao has invested a lot, right?

31:13.053 --> 31:17.288
All the infrastructure has
been built, if he leaves now,

31:17.292 --> 31:19.492
all his efforts will be in vain.

31:19.532 --> 31:21.876
He can sell them.

31:23.212 --> 31:25.172
But the one who's willing to take over

31:25.172 --> 31:28.428
should see the value in everything he did,

31:28.452 --> 31:29.732
right?

31:30.732 --> 31:32.404
That's true.

31:35.652 --> 31:39.932
Well... It's just like a mosquito
flies into a spider's web,

31:39.932 --> 31:42.668
it can't even fly away
and is trapped there.

31:42.692 --> 31:44.940
Why did he do all this?

31:49.252 --> 31:50.492
Uncle Xie.

31:50.492 --> 31:52.836
Do you want to hear my story?

31:53.412 --> 31:54.492
Sure.

31:54.492 --> 31:55.772
Look.

31:55.772 --> 31:58.732
After I graduated from college,
I had been working in Beijing.

31:58.732 --> 32:01.412
The hotel industry is particularly busy.

32:01.692 --> 32:04.332
Occasionally, when customers thank me,

32:04.332 --> 32:07.508
I also feel a sense of accomplishment and value,

32:07.532 --> 32:08.172
right?

32:08.172 --> 32:09.844
But most of the time,

32:10.212 --> 32:12.172
I did my work automatically.

32:12.812 --> 32:15.012
I worked for more than a decade,

32:16.012 --> 32:18.492
and like most people,

32:18.492 --> 32:23.788
I was thinking about making money
to buy a house and a car, right?

32:23.812 --> 32:26.812
This way, I can settle in Beijing.

32:26.812 --> 32:29.932
And when I go back to
my hometown, the relatives

32:29.932 --> 32:31.732
will think I'm very successful, right?

32:31.732 --> 32:32.972
And very excellent.

32:32.972 --> 32:34.972
And I could be a role model

32:34.972 --> 32:37.292
who encourages the next generation
to study hard.

32:37.292 --> 32:38.592
How nice that is.

32:40.172 --> 32:42.132
But I never thought about

32:43.812 --> 32:46.708
whether success in the traditional sense

32:46.732 --> 32:48.884
is what I really want.

32:49.892 --> 32:52.756
For example, look.

32:54.972 --> 32:57.292
For example, if I only
have three months to live

32:57.292 --> 32:59.348
before I leave this world,

33:01.012 --> 33:03.212
then what exactly do I want to do?

33:03.212 --> 33:04.492
What is my dream?

33:04.492 --> 33:05.252
What do I want?

33:05.252 --> 33:07.452
I never thought about
this and I don't know.

33:07.452 --> 33:09.592
This has never crossed my mind.

33:11.492 --> 33:12.772
However,

33:13.172 --> 33:15.276
Yao and Xinxin are different.

33:15.772 --> 33:20.612
They have a firm goal,
and an ideal to fight for.

33:22.932 --> 33:24.460
I really envy them

33:26.252 --> 33:28.116
and I admire them.

33:28.452 --> 33:31.312
They're not just thinking about themselves,

33:31.532 --> 33:34.412
and they don't focus on
what's right in front of them.

33:34.412 --> 33:36.252
They have to go to a place further away,

33:36.252 --> 33:38.872
and they want to take others with them.

33:39.172 --> 33:40.712
A place further away?

33:41.652 --> 33:42.932
Where is it?

33:43.732 --> 33:44.972
Isn't it Beijing?

33:44.972 --> 33:47.652
Is there any place further than Beijing?

33:48.012 --> 33:49.396
Of course.

33:49.572 --> 33:51.484
What about

33:51.572 --> 33:53.916
Yunmiao Village in the future?

33:54.732 --> 34:00.492
By then, everyone won't
need to leave here for money.

34:00.492 --> 34:02.788
All those who left will come back.

34:02.812 --> 34:04.732
They've already left. How can they come back?

34:04.732 --> 34:05.932
They can.

34:05.932 --> 34:08.192
If the village is well-developed.

34:08.892 --> 34:11.492
They can build and protect
their hometown, right?

34:11.492 --> 34:14.252
Then every young people can use their talents,

34:14.252 --> 34:15.772
every kid will grow up with their family around,

34:15.772 --> 34:18.392
and the elderly will be well cared for.

34:21.332 --> 34:22.612
Uncle.

34:23.332 --> 34:25.908
You and your wife worked so hard

34:25.932 --> 34:28.624
to pay for his education
and changed his life.

34:29.012 --> 34:30.444
Now

34:30.772 --> 34:33.268
he came back with money and knowledge,

34:33.292 --> 34:35.792
trying to change more people's lives.

34:38.492 --> 34:40.260
The reason you left

34:40.532 --> 34:42.432
is the reason he came back.

34:43.772 --> 34:48.508
Don't you think we should support
and encourage him, and trust him?

34:54.212 --> 34:56.412
When are we gonna finish them?

34:56.692 --> 35:00.052
These are all the things
Yuan and his mother like to eat.

35:00.052 --> 35:01.732
You have a big fridge anyway.

35:01.732 --> 35:04.112
Just take your time to finish them.

35:04.572 --> 35:05.852
All loaded.

35:05.972 --> 35:07.452
Drive safe.

35:07.452 --> 35:08.532
It'll take hours.

35:08.532 --> 35:10.492
Take a rest at the service station.

35:10.492 --> 35:11.772
I know.

35:12.492 --> 35:13.772
Mom.

35:14.172 --> 35:15.452
Listen to Yao.

35:17.692 --> 35:19.172
Call us if you need anything.

35:19.172 --> 35:20.452
Got it.

35:26.052 --> 35:27.332
Do a good job.

35:34.132 --> 35:35.756
Mom, I'm leaving.

35:45.612 --> 35:47.284
Did your dad

35:47.372 --> 35:49.292
say some harsh words?

35:49.292 --> 35:50.572
No.

35:50.812 --> 35:53.676
Didn't you hear him say "do a good job"?

35:55.212 --> 35:57.988
That's rare.

36:07.892 --> 36:08.932
President Xie.

36:08.932 --> 36:10.332
Want a cup of coffee?

36:10.332 --> 36:11.860
No, I'll drink this.

36:12.852 --> 36:14.132
Where's Hongdou?

36:14.212 --> 36:15.172
In the room.

36:15.172 --> 36:16.132
You're looking for her?

36:16.132 --> 36:17.792
No, I'm just wondering.

36:36.932 --> 36:39.252
Why did you come in the afternoon?

36:39.732 --> 36:43.732
I just passed here on my way to
the village committee to see Huang.

36:43.892 --> 36:45.900
Is it in the same direction?

36:46.252 --> 36:47.972
Where did you come from?

36:48.572 --> 36:50.340
Make me a cup of coffee.

36:51.252 --> 36:53.308
I thought you didn't want it.

36:53.332 --> 36:55.772
I'm just testing whether
Hongdou's improved

36:55.772 --> 36:57.572
her skills in making coffee.

36:57.572 --> 36:59.092
He just does it on purpose.

36:59.092 --> 37:01.652
Then I'll make you a pour-over coffee.

37:02.252 --> 37:02.773
Good for you.

37:02.773 --> 37:03.852
You know how to make pour-over coffee now?

37:03.852 --> 37:05.332
I taught her.

37:06.332 --> 37:07.752
This is my teacher.

37:21.972 --> 37:26.972
♫ Seeing a star and a rainbow ♫

37:26.972 --> 37:30.132
♫ every step of your journey ♫

37:31.412 --> 37:35.196
♫ We've missed and hugged each other ♫

37:35.532 --> 37:37.072
Why are you laughing?

37:37.732 --> 37:39.332
Because you're clumsy.

37:40.732 --> 37:42.212
You were born to do everything.

37:42.212 --> 37:44.112
You've never been a rookie.

37:46.212 --> 37:47.492
Give me.

37:47.612 --> 37:48.092
Let me help you.

37:48.092 --> 37:48.732
Put it here.

37:48.732 --> 37:50.012
Grind.

37:51.092 --> 37:52.372
Grind.

37:54.012 --> 37:54.653
Come on.

37:54.653 --> 37:59.852
♫ Say goodbye to the passing time ♫

37:59.852 --> 38:00.293
Good.

38:00.293 --> 38:01.412
You're getting better.

38:01.412 --> 38:01.933
Come on.

38:01.933 --> 38:04.133
You make me forget how to do it.

38:05.372 --> 38:06.948
Why are you laughing?

38:09.852 --> 38:11.292
I don't know why he's laughing.

38:11.292 --> 38:13.732
I just can't help but want to laugh.

38:15.172 --> 38:19.628
♫ Sometimes I find I fall in love ♫

38:20.172 --> 38:23.332
♫ Make a little wish and pray ♫

38:23.332 --> 38:24.732
President Xie's dad came.

38:24.732 --> 38:26.012
So what?

38:27.252 --> 38:27.813
You joined us late.

38:27.813 --> 38:29.052
You don't know.

38:29.052 --> 38:32.612
He went to the warehouse the
other day, and then sat at my table

38:32.612 --> 38:33.732
and asked so many questions.

38:33.732 --> 38:38.372
Like how the business is going,
and anything special happen.

38:38.372 --> 38:39.332
He looked for Ye Sen.

38:39.332 --> 38:41.532
I said Ye Sen took a day off.

38:41.572 --> 38:44.292
I waited until he left yesterday,
then I went to the tie-dye workshop.

38:44.292 --> 38:45.692
But he's so crafty.

38:45.692 --> 38:47.692
He kept asking me questions
as soon as he saw me.

38:47.692 --> 38:50.052
I've never been that nervous
even when I took the exams.

38:50.052 --> 38:51.132
Why?

38:51.132 --> 38:52.132
Why?

38:52.132 --> 38:52.932
Let me ask you.

38:52.932 --> 38:57.212
Since our company was established,
what has been the biggest obstacle?

38:57.212 --> 38:58.752
The biggest obstacle?

38:59.452 --> 39:00.652
No tourists.

39:00.652 --> 39:01.732
Instability of online sales.

39:01.732 --> 39:03.012
No.

39:03.452 --> 39:06.052
Then it's... It's President Xie's dad.

39:06.052 --> 39:07.052
[Dramatic effects. Do not imitate.]
I don't agree with you

39:07.052 --> 39:09.252
[It's cola in the bottle.]
to sign the contract!

39:09.252 --> 39:12.508
If you have to sign it,
I'll drink the pesticides!

39:13.012 --> 39:14.252
Dad.

39:14.252 --> 39:15.812
So many people are watching.

39:15.812 --> 39:16.812
Let's go home first.

39:16.812 --> 39:18.092
Don't come over!

39:18.412 --> 39:19.812
I'll swallow it if you do.

39:19.812 --> 39:20.812
I really will.

39:20.812 --> 39:21.892
Would you stop making a scene?

39:21.892 --> 39:23.996
The village director is here.

39:24.292 --> 39:26.252
Well... It doesn't matter if
the village director comes.

39:26.252 --> 39:27.212
Siping.

39:27.212 --> 39:27.813
Don't come over.

39:27.813 --> 39:29.732
What are you doing?

39:29.732 --> 39:32.892
I don't agree with him taking
over this tie-dye workshop!

39:32.892 --> 39:35.228
Director, I wanna hear your opinion.

39:35.252 --> 39:37.732
He quit his job in Beijing with good pay,

39:37.732 --> 39:39.332
and insisted on coming back
and start a business.

39:39.332 --> 39:41.892
I've been doing business for so many years.

39:41.892 --> 39:43.892
Is it easy to do business?

39:43.892 --> 39:44.412
Alright.

39:44.412 --> 39:45.812
Just go home and talk to him.

39:45.812 --> 39:46.372
No.

39:46.372 --> 39:48.212
Or you can go to the village committee.

39:48.212 --> 39:48.892
I'm not going.

39:48.892 --> 39:49.732
Take your time to drink it.

39:49.732 --> 39:51.152
I'll sign it first.

39:52.732 --> 39:53.652
Siping!

39:53.652 --> 39:54.732
What are you doing?

39:54.732 --> 39:56.172
Don't tear up the contract.

39:56.172 --> 39:57.612
Are you crazy?

39:57.612 --> 39:58.612
I dare you.

39:58.612 --> 40:00.252
You tore the contract up.

40:00.252 --> 40:01.052
You can't sign it!

40:01.052 --> 40:01.253
Alright.

40:01.253 --> 40:03.388
Let's talk in my office.

40:03.412 --> 40:04.372
I won't allow him!

40:04.372 --> 40:05.652
Yao.

40:05.932 --> 40:06.892
Dir- Yao, come with us.

40:06.892 --> 40:08.252
You can't sign it.

40:09.092 --> 40:10.692
Don't let him sign it.

40:11.932 --> 40:12.812
Don't let him sign it!

40:12.812 --> 40:15.204
Let's talk it out.

40:15.252 --> 40:15.932
Gezi.

40:15.932 --> 40:17.212
Mr. Xie.

40:17.212 --> 40:19.452
Print another copy of the contract.

40:19.452 --> 40:21.892
Well, this... It's fine.

40:21.892 --> 40:22.732
He cherishes his life.

40:22.732 --> 40:24.032
It's cola inside.

40:26.412 --> 40:27.692
Well...

40:27.892 --> 40:28.333
Aunties.

40:28.333 --> 40:29.332
Don't watch.

40:29.332 --> 40:30.252
It's alright.

40:30.252 --> 40:30.892
Go home, go home.

40:30.892 --> 40:32.172
Go get busy.

40:33.892 --> 40:34.612
Uncle.

40:34.612 --> 40:36.272
Look what you're doing.

40:36.732 --> 40:38.452
It rains when Heaven deems fit,

40:38.452 --> 40:39.132
your son wants to start a business
when he wants to.

40:39.132 --> 40:39.892
You can't stop him.

40:39.892 --> 40:41.052
Right?

40:41.052 --> 40:43.132
He wants to run the homestay, right?

40:43.132 --> 40:44.516
Fine. Come on.

40:45.732 --> 40:46.692
Run over me!

40:46.692 --> 40:47.413
Uncle, get up.

40:47.413 --> 40:48.612
Run over me!

40:48.612 --> 40:49.173
Go through me first.

40:49.173 --> 40:50.212
Then he can do whatever he wants.

40:50.212 --> 40:50.732
Get up, uncle.

40:50.732 --> 40:52.692
He can do whatever he wants.

40:54.012 --> 40:55.292
Excuse me.

40:55.372 --> 40:56.732
Ye Sen, what happened?

40:56.732 --> 40:58.356
He... He hit my leg.

40:59.252 --> 41:00.612
Why did you hit people?

41:00.612 --> 41:01.892
I didn't.

41:01.892 --> 41:04.212
Come on, let's go to the hospital.

41:04.692 --> 41:06.172
Don't come over.

41:08.532 --> 41:09.252
Yao.

41:09.252 --> 41:10.332
Your dad's here.

41:10.332 --> 41:11.692
What should we do?

41:12.012 --> 41:13.212
Run him over.

41:13.212 --> 41:15.892
If he's not afraid of the pain, just lie there.

41:15.892 --> 41:17.172
You...

41:19.332 --> 41:20.716
I don't agree!

41:21.252 --> 41:22.532
You brat!

41:58.412 --> 41:59.692
Good.

42:00.252 --> 42:01.684
Good for you.

42:04.052 --> 42:05.532
Push, push.

42:08.212 --> 42:09.132
Be careful.

42:09.132 --> 42:09.812
Careful.

42:09.812 --> 42:11.092
Watch your head.

42:12.092 --> 42:12.812
Mr. Xie.

42:12.812 --> 42:14.244
Step aside.

42:27.732 --> 42:29.012
What?

42:37.892 --> 42:38.732
Come on.

42:38.732 --> 42:40.012
Come on in.

42:46.772 --> 42:48.108
Yao!

42:51.132 --> 42:52.412
Do you get it?

42:52.612 --> 42:56.828
Every time I think of this
old man, my leg hurts.

42:57.572 --> 42:58.013
You know what?

42:58.013 --> 42:59.652
Fortunately, his father
has a business in Kunming

42:59.652 --> 43:00.612
and can't be here every day.

43:00.612 --> 43:01.532
In the last two years,

43:01.532 --> 43:03.572
he came back to make a scene
whenever he got time.

43:03.572 --> 43:04.812
Now he doesn't do it so frequently.

43:04.812 --> 43:07.312
But he keeps asking people questions.

43:08.172 --> 43:09.332
I don't think his dad has given up.

43:09.332 --> 43:10.292
Do you believe it?

43:10.292 --> 43:11.572
Of course.

43:11.852 --> 43:14.292
Look at the mess you made.

43:15.012 --> 43:16.292
You're back.

43:17.652 --> 43:19.452
Mr. Xie, has your dad left?

43:19.452 --> 43:20.732
Yeah.

43:22.332 --> 43:23.572
That's good.

43:23.572 --> 43:25.352
That's good, that's good.

43:26.652 --> 43:29.212
Well, why are you afraid of him?

43:29.212 --> 43:31.092
When he made such a big
scene, I still wasn't afraid of him.

43:31.092 --> 43:32.932
Only you aren't afraid of Uncle Siping, alright?

43:32.932 --> 43:34.868
We're all afraid of him.

43:34.892 --> 43:38.188
This time, he told me to do a good job.

43:38.212 --> 43:39.852
Alright, after you clean it
up, come for the meeting.

43:39.852 --> 43:41.132
OK.

43:41.332 --> 43:42.652
Done.

43:42.652 --> 43:49.172
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

43:50.092 --> 43:55.988
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

43:57.492 --> 44:03.892
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

44:03.892 --> 44:10.268
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

44:12.212 --> 44:18.636
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

44:19.572 --> 44:25.372
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

44:27.012 --> 44:33.532
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

44:33.532 --> 44:40.916
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

44:41.812 --> 44:48.252
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

44:48.252 --> 44:56.252
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

44:56.412 --> 44:58.452
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

44:58.452 --> 45:03.092
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

45:03.092 --> 45:11.396
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

45:15.092 --> 45:21.228
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

45:22.412 --> 45:28.788
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

45:29.812 --> 45:36.212
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

45:36.212 --> 45:44.212
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

45:44.572 --> 45:51.052
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
